WEBVTT

00:01:36.580 --> 00:01:38.470
Kuu-chan, are you okay?

00:01:38.470 --> 00:01:41.430
Why is it so hot every day?

00:01:41.430 --> 00:01:43.650
Hmm... because it's summer?

00:01:43.650 --> 00:01:45.430
It sure is.

00:01:45.430 --> 00:01:46.080
Yeah...

00:01:47.300 --> 00:01:51.690
That's right! When it's this hot in summer, 
I want to go to the ocean!

00:01:51.690 --> 00:01:52.710
Don't you, Hina-chan?

00:01:52.710 --> 00:01:58.430
U-Uh... I've never been 
to the ocean, so I'm not sure.

00:01:58.430 --> 00:02:00.450
My family lived deep in the mountains, so...

00:02:00.450 --> 00:02:01.810
Really?

00:02:01.810 --> 00:02:02.600
Yeah.

00:02:03.080 --> 00:02:05.220
The ocean is great!

00:02:05.220 --> 00:02:08.280
Shaved ice, yakisoba, ramen, 
watermelon-splitting...

00:02:08.280 --> 00:02:10.230
Those all have to do with food.

00:02:10.230 --> 00:02:12.280
Oh, morning, Yua-chan.

00:02:12.280 --> 00:02:13.380
Morning.

00:02:15.060 --> 00:02:16.730
Wh-What?

00:02:16.730 --> 00:02:17.610
I know!

00:02:17.610 --> 00:02:20.090
Let's all go to the ocean this weekend!

00:02:20.090 --> 00:02:20.610
Huh?

00:02:22.400 --> 00:02:24.790
O-Oh, all right...

00:02:24.790 --> 00:02:28.070
If you insist, I guess I 
don't mind going with you.

00:02:28.070 --> 00:02:29.500
Then it's settled!

00:02:29.500 --> 00:02:33.750
Wait a minute... Isn't the ocean 
dangerous because of shark attacks?

00:02:33.750 --> 00:02:37.120
This isn't some panic movie. It'll be fine!

00:02:37.120 --> 00:02:38.210
Really?

00:02:38.210 --> 00:02:39.170
Yeah!

00:02:39.170 --> 00:02:43.640
Thank goodness! I can go to 
the ocean without worrying, then.

00:02:43.800 --> 00:02:47.550
But animals tend to like you, Hina-chan.

00:02:47.550 --> 00:02:49.890
Maybe they'll come to you 
when you're swimming...

00:02:50.060 --> 00:02:50.710
Huh?

00:02:52.300 --> 00:02:57.090
Swim, swim... swim, swim, swim...

00:03:05.940 --> 00:03:09.180
Kuu-chan, if it comes to it, 
leave me behind and run!

00:03:09.180 --> 00:03:10.660
I was just kidding.

00:03:10.660 --> 00:03:14.420
But if you're scared of the ocean, 
can't you just play on the beach?

00:03:14.420 --> 00:03:16.590
O-Oh, yeah...

00:03:16.590 --> 00:03:20.140
But if I'm going to the ocean, 
I would like to swim.

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:24.010
Actually, I don't even have a swimsuit...

00:03:24.010 --> 00:03:26.340
Then let's go buy swimsuits after school.

00:03:26.340 --> 00:03:27.430
Good idea!

00:03:28.650 --> 00:03:31.060
I've been wanting a new one!

00:03:31.060 --> 00:03:33.280
A new swimsuit...

00:03:33.860 --> 00:03:38.290
Will I be able to pick a swimsuit 
that works for me?

00:03:38.290 --> 00:03:41.990
I don't know what kind is in right now...

00:03:44.010 --> 00:03:46.450
You can just leave that to me!

00:03:46.450 --> 00:03:49.870
I'll pick the perfect swimsuit 
for you, Hina-chan!

00:03:50.250 --> 00:03:52.410
M-Mayu-chan?

00:03:52.410 --> 00:03:55.920
Aren't the second-year classrooms upstairs?

00:03:56.920 --> 00:03:58.460
I felt I was being called.

00:03:58.460 --> 00:04:03.470
<b>The Lost Swimsuit</b>

00:04:13.480 --> 00:04:15.050
Wow, this is amazing!

00:04:15.480 --> 00:04:17.980
So this is a department store!

00:04:17.980 --> 00:04:21.510
This is my first time shopping with friends,

00:04:21.510 --> 00:04:23.380
so I'm really excited!

00:04:23.380 --> 00:04:26.720
It'll be my first time in the swimsuit 
department, so I'm excited, too!

00:04:30.620 --> 00:04:32.520
There are so many!

00:04:32.520 --> 00:04:33.870
Oh, look!

00:04:33.870 --> 00:04:36.030
That one's really cute!

00:04:36.030 --> 00:04:38.130
Oh, you're right!

00:04:38.130 --> 00:04:40.520
And how about this flowery one?

00:04:40.520 --> 00:04:42.120
It's cute, too!

00:04:42.120 --> 00:04:45.030
And this chic style is nice, too!

00:04:45.030 --> 00:04:46.860
Yeah! I want to try it on!

00:04:46.860 --> 00:04:48.640
Hey, you two!

00:04:48.810 --> 00:04:51.270
You're going to disturb the other customers.

00:04:51.270 --> 00:04:52.810
Don't be so loud.

00:04:51.740 --> 00:04:53.640
Yua-chan, look at this one!

00:04:53.640 --> 00:04:54.680
Let me see!

00:04:54.680 --> 00:04:56.940
Wow, it's nice!

00:04:56.940 --> 00:04:57.810
Isn't it?

00:04:58.560 --> 00:05:02.190
Mayu-chan, there are so many, I can't decide!

00:05:02.190 --> 00:05:04.900
I know, but don't worry.

00:05:04.900 --> 00:05:08.820
I'll give all my effort to 
helping you choose a swimsuit.

00:05:08.920 --> 00:05:10.700
Okay! Thanks!

00:05:10.700 --> 00:05:11.920
You can count on me.

00:05:13.900 --> 00:05:16.290
Good luck, Hina-chan...

00:05:20.410 --> 00:05:22.520
What do you think, Mayu-chan?

00:05:24.590 --> 00:05:26.340
Yeah, it's cute.

00:05:26.710 --> 00:05:29.020
All right, try this one next.

00:05:29.020 --> 00:05:31.040
Okay, I'll try it.

00:05:36.540 --> 00:05:39.680
How many more is she going to make me try on?

00:05:41.000 --> 00:05:42.160
Ta-da!

00:05:42.600 --> 00:05:44.070
How do I look?

00:05:44.070 --> 00:05:46.610
It suits you, but I'm surprised 
that was your choice.

00:05:46.830 --> 00:05:49.780
I thought you'd pick a more revealing one.

00:05:50.740 --> 00:05:53.780
Well... I've gained a little weight lately,

00:05:53.780 --> 00:05:55.800
so I want to cover my stomach.

00:05:55.800 --> 00:05:58.500
I really was planning to buy a bikini, but...

00:05:58.500 --> 00:06:02.000
With your proportions, 
I think you're perfectly thin now.

00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:04.000
Ch-Chiaki-senpai!

00:06:05.400 --> 00:06:07.010
You don't need to worry.

00:06:09.400 --> 00:06:12.510
Hearing that from you 
makes me more confident!

00:06:12.510 --> 00:06:15.020
I'm going to try on a bikini right now!

00:06:15.890 --> 00:06:18.350
She switches gears fast...

00:06:20.350 --> 00:06:22.760
This one's kind of a funny shape.

00:06:22.760 --> 00:06:26.170
Is this the first time 
you've worn one like that?

00:06:26.170 --> 00:06:29.140
Yeah... or to be exact,

00:06:29.140 --> 00:06:32.290
I've never worn anything 
but school swimsuits.

00:06:32.290 --> 00:06:33.530
Really?

00:06:33.890 --> 00:06:37.640
Then we were right 
to go swimsuit shopping today!

00:06:37.640 --> 00:06:41.850
No high schooler wants to go to 
the ocean wearing a school swimsuit.

00:06:41.850 --> 00:06:44.460
I'm planning to go in my school swimsuit.

00:06:44.460 --> 00:06:45.920
Huh? You are?

00:06:45.920 --> 00:06:49.420
Yes. The one I used in 
elementary school still fits,

00:06:49.420 --> 00:06:50.970
so I don't see the need to buy one.

00:06:52.360 --> 00:06:54.680
I see... That is an option...

00:06:55.010 --> 00:06:59.310
Mayu-chan, I still have my swimsuit 
from last year, so I—

00:06:59.310 --> 00:07:02.530
No! You have to buy a new one, Aki-chan!

00:07:02.530 --> 00:07:05.320
You can't use that one! No, no, no!

00:07:02.910 --> 00:07:04.480
O-Okay...

00:07:09.090 --> 00:07:10.450
What do you think?

00:07:10.450 --> 00:07:14.830
You look so composed and beautiful 
in a swimsuit, Miss Landlady!

00:07:14.830 --> 00:07:16.950
You have grown-up appeal!

00:07:16.950 --> 00:07:19.460
You do like simple styles, 
don't you, Aki-chan?

00:07:19.460 --> 00:07:23.200
I figure I could wear something 
like this at home, too.

00:07:23.520 --> 00:07:26.210
Or, like, when I clean the bath.

00:07:26.210 --> 00:07:28.270
You use yours on normal days?

00:07:28.270 --> 00:07:29.330
Yeah.

00:07:29.330 --> 00:07:33.730
I only wear a swimsuit a few times 
in a year, so it's wasted otherwise.

00:07:33.730 --> 00:07:37.420
I'm not sure if that's 
economical or realistic...

00:07:38.740 --> 00:07:39.850
Well...

00:07:39.990 --> 00:07:42.430
Now that everyone else 
is done picking swimsuits,

00:07:42.430 --> 00:07:45.040
I should pick one for myself, too...

00:07:45.390 --> 00:07:47.260
Let's see...

00:07:47.260 --> 00:07:50.340
My, what a cute little girl!

00:07:50.340 --> 00:07:52.430
What are you looking for?

00:07:53.380 --> 00:07:54.880
W-Well... um...

00:07:54.880 --> 00:07:56.590
You look like a doll!

00:07:56.590 --> 00:07:58.930
I'm sure any swimsuit would look good on you.

00:07:58.930 --> 00:08:00.250
No, really...

00:08:00.450 --> 00:08:03.570
Let me see... For you...

00:08:03.570 --> 00:08:05.270
How about that one?

00:08:09.350 --> 00:08:10.600
What do you think?

00:08:10.600 --> 00:08:13.090
I-I'll go get my mom.

00:08:13.090 --> 00:08:14.320
I'll be waiting!

00:08:20.280 --> 00:08:23.020
I'm... I'm not a child...

00:08:29.750 --> 00:08:31.650
All right! If that's how it is,

00:08:31.650 --> 00:08:35.030
I'll show off how grown-up 
I can look with a sexy swimsuit!

00:08:37.040 --> 00:08:39.560
Well, I tried to pick one,

00:08:39.560 --> 00:08:41.820
but I don't think this is quite right...

00:08:43.380 --> 00:08:45.550
Um, excuse me...

00:08:45.870 --> 00:08:47.600
Could I get another...

00:08:52.210 --> 00:08:55.110
Um... Th-This is, well...

00:08:55.300 --> 00:08:58.660
You can't wear that, Mayu-chan! 
You'll catch a chill!

00:08:58.660 --> 00:09:02.680
I don't think you're ready 
for that kind of swimsuit yet.

00:09:04.140 --> 00:09:05.060
Darn it!

00:09:05.060 --> 00:09:07.700
Stop treating me like a child!

00:09:05.060 --> 00:09:09.570
<b>-Why bananas?
I wonder why you can only have up to 500 yen for your snacks on field trips...
I hear people ask if bananas count as snacks all the time, but why does that come up? Because they're cheap and there's more than one? Does that mean that it counts as a meal since it fills you up?
-I guess it doesn't really matter, but I'm curious...</b>

00:09:09.570 --> 00:09:11.620
Thank you very much.

00:09:12.890 --> 00:09:15.310
I ended up getting a one-piece.

00:09:15.310 --> 00:09:17.570
I hope it won't look too childish.

00:09:20.760 --> 00:09:22.690
<i>Mayu-senpai looks worried.</i>

00:09:23.020 --> 00:09:23.950
<i>Is this about...?</i>

00:09:25.500 --> 00:09:26.690
Mayu-senpai?

00:09:27.820 --> 00:09:30.570
Oh, sorry to keep you all waiting.

00:09:30.570 --> 00:09:31.460
Um...

00:09:31.750 --> 00:09:35.200
Mayu-senpai, are you... um...

00:09:35.650 --> 00:09:37.970
worried about how small you are?

00:09:37.970 --> 00:09:40.200
Huh? Small?

00:09:40.200 --> 00:09:42.600
I'm insecure about that, too.

00:09:43.990 --> 00:09:47.460
<i>Yua-chan worries about her height, too?</i>

00:09:48.080 --> 00:09:51.790
I don't think you're small enough 
that you need to worry.

00:09:51.790 --> 00:09:54.050
I'd say you're about average, actually.

00:09:54.050 --> 00:09:55.360
Really?

00:09:55.360 --> 00:09:58.110
But I'm only an A-cup...

00:09:58.300 --> 00:09:59.110
Huh?

00:10:00.610 --> 00:10:03.530
<i>Th-That's what she meant?</i>

00:10:06.870 --> 00:10:09.120
I can't wait to go to the ocean!

00:10:09.320 --> 00:10:11.380
I got a really nice swimsuit, too.

00:10:11.380 --> 00:10:13.410
I'm excited to go swimming!

00:10:14.140 --> 00:10:15.630
Shark!

00:10:15.980 --> 00:10:18.510
I'm gonna eat you, Hina-chan!

00:10:18.720 --> 00:10:20.010
Gotcha!

00:10:20.010 --> 00:10:23.140
A-Actually, I think I might be 
scared of the ocean...

00:10:23.450 --> 00:10:26.140
I-I was just kidding, really!

00:10:36.040 --> 00:10:38.370
I'm so excited to go to the ocean.

00:10:42.530 --> 00:10:45.790
That's right... it's going to be my first time 
at the ocean, so just in case...

00:10:50.450 --> 00:10:53.250
What is Hina-chan doing?

00:10:53.250 --> 00:10:54.290
Not sure...

00:11:01.130 --> 00:11:02.930
Swimming practice?

00:11:05.820 --> 00:11:06.810
She stopped.

00:11:08.230 --> 00:11:10.310
Help!

00:11:11.100 --> 00:11:13.890
I guess she's practicing 
what to do in case of drowning.

00:11:11.100 --> 00:11:13.890
Someone help!

00:11:14.670 --> 00:11:17.070
There's a shark!

00:11:17.070 --> 00:11:20.460
Help! I'm drowni—

00:11:25.000 --> 00:11:26.510
Shark!

00:11:27.040 --> 00:11:29.640
H-Help!

00:11:29.640 --> 00:11:30.960
Shark!

00:11:38.810 --> 00:11:41.930
S-So this is the ocean!

00:11:44.670 --> 00:11:46.390
It's the ocean, Hina-chan!

00:11:46.390 --> 00:11:48.200
Ocean! Ocean!

00:11:48.200 --> 00:11:49.560
Let's hurry and go swimming!

00:11:49.560 --> 00:11:52.810
We need to make sure we stretch first.

00:11:52.810 --> 00:11:54.310
Okay!

00:12:05.770 --> 00:12:08.580
There! All done stretching!

00:12:08.580 --> 00:12:09.880
Hina-chan.

00:12:10.540 --> 00:12:12.460
Do you know how to swim?

00:12:12.460 --> 00:12:15.960
Yes, though I'm not very good at it.

00:12:15.960 --> 00:12:18.590
Are you a good swimmer?

00:12:19.900 --> 00:12:22.660
Chiaki-senpai excels at all sports!

00:12:22.660 --> 00:12:24.350
Of course she's a good swimmer!

00:12:24.350 --> 00:12:26.050
I'm just normal.

00:12:26.050 --> 00:12:27.600
But last year...

00:12:28.120 --> 00:12:32.380
Didn't you swim in a tournament 
as an emergency substitute and win?

00:12:32.380 --> 00:12:34.160
Really? Wow!

00:12:34.350 --> 00:12:36.930
I'm surprised you know about that.

00:12:36.930 --> 00:12:43.410
Oh, I just happened to see a photo of it 
outside the swim team's club room...

00:12:46.940 --> 00:12:49.240
So, Yua-chan, you can't...

00:12:49.380 --> 00:12:50.180
Huh?

00:12:51.750 --> 00:12:55.010
N-No! I can swim fine,

00:12:55.010 --> 00:12:57.800
but if I get caught in a current, 
my feet won't touch the bottom!

00:12:57.800 --> 00:13:00.980
So wouldn't that mean you can't swim?

00:13:00.980 --> 00:13:04.020
Anyway! Let's just go swim now!

00:13:04.020 --> 00:13:05.710
Y-Yeah, let's.

00:13:09.380 --> 00:13:11.810
This feels so nice!

00:13:09.490 --> 00:13:11.330
That's it, that's it.

00:13:11.810 --> 00:13:13.140
You're doing great.

00:13:13.140 --> 00:13:14.810
Whee!

00:13:18.130 --> 00:13:18.900
Take that!

00:13:23.320 --> 00:13:24.850
S-Sorry...

00:13:28.110 --> 00:13:29.530
I've got it!

00:13:32.730 --> 00:13:33.940
Got—

00:13:37.500 --> 00:13:39.420
I'm thirsty.

00:13:39.420 --> 00:13:41.830
I'm going to go buy some drinks.

00:13:41.830 --> 00:13:44.070
Try not to get lost.

00:13:45.160 --> 00:13:47.590
Come on! I'll be fine!

00:13:47.940 --> 00:13:53.810
Jeez... Kuu-chan is always 
treating me like a child.

00:13:54.090 --> 00:13:56.220
I'm the shortest in the group,

00:13:56.220 --> 00:13:59.060
but I'm still a year older than she is.

00:13:59.060 --> 00:14:01.690
She should rely on me more...

00:14:04.170 --> 00:14:07.820
Huh? What is this place?

00:14:10.620 --> 00:14:15.240
What do I do? I need to 
contact Aki-chan somehow...

00:14:15.840 --> 00:14:18.290
But I left my cell phone back there.

00:14:20.420 --> 00:14:21.420
Huh?

00:14:22.120 --> 00:14:24.750
That little girl is out here alone?

00:14:25.050 --> 00:14:26.350
Is she lost?

00:14:27.790 --> 00:14:31.250
But she doesn't look like 
an ordinary little girl...

00:14:33.450 --> 00:14:36.480
Wait... Kuroyanagi-sensei?!

00:14:36.480 --> 00:14:38.480
Oh. Greetings.

00:14:38.670 --> 00:14:43.270
Um... Sensei, what are you doing here?

00:14:43.270 --> 00:14:46.480
I'm filming a drama near here.

00:14:46.480 --> 00:14:49.670
I'm waiting for my next scene now, 
so I took a walk.

00:14:51.260 --> 00:14:54.120
Are you appearing in the drama, too?

00:14:54.120 --> 00:14:55.980
N-No!

00:14:55.980 --> 00:14:59.750
Oh... I thought you had 
entered show business.

00:15:00.010 --> 00:15:05.710
I always thought it was a 
terrible shame for someone

00:15:05.710 --> 00:15:09.760
as sweet and beautiful as you 
not to strive for a job in show business.

00:15:09.760 --> 00:15:13.290
Oh, I know. Since fate somehow 
brought us together here,

00:15:13.290 --> 00:15:16.610
why don't you take this opportunity 
to enter show business?

00:15:17.180 --> 00:15:18.520
No, thank you!

00:15:20.210 --> 00:15:21.370
I see.

00:15:22.200 --> 00:15:24.400
Too bad. By the way,

00:15:24.400 --> 00:15:27.270
are the girls you're usually with 
not here today?

00:15:27.270 --> 00:15:32.280
Oh... Actually, they are here, 
but I've lost sight of them.

00:15:33.210 --> 00:15:35.030
Could it be that you're...

00:15:35.030 --> 00:15:36.290
lost?

00:15:36.830 --> 00:15:38.490
N-No, I'm not!

00:15:38.490 --> 00:15:39.370
Then...

00:15:39.830 --> 00:15:42.920
We don't need to contact 
Chiaki-san, I take it?

00:15:42.920 --> 00:15:45.090
I'd rather we did!

00:15:49.800 --> 00:15:51.930
Mayu-chan sure is taking a while.

00:15:52.090 --> 00:15:53.080
Yeah...

00:15:53.900 --> 00:15:55.870
Maybe she got lost.

00:15:59.870 --> 00:16:01.620
I'll try calling her.

00:16:06.080 --> 00:16:07.630
The line's busy.

00:16:07.630 --> 00:16:08.730
What?

00:16:08.730 --> 00:16:12.320
For the time being, 
which direction did you come from?

00:16:12.320 --> 00:16:16.320
Um... I think it was that way...

00:16:16.320 --> 00:16:17.720
Then let's go.

00:16:18.520 --> 00:16:20.130
O-Okay...

00:16:21.850 --> 00:16:22.960
It's no use.

00:16:22.960 --> 00:16:24.960
Mayu-chan isn't answering.

00:16:24.960 --> 00:16:27.550
Should we have them make 
a lost child announcement?

00:16:27.550 --> 00:16:31.210
That might embarrass Mayu-senpai so much
 that she wouldn't come back.

00:16:31.210 --> 00:16:33.220
That's true...

00:16:33.810 --> 00:16:34.860
Oh...

00:16:35.540 --> 00:16:38.000
Mayu-chan left her phone here.

00:16:38.590 --> 00:16:42.070
Wh-What do we do?! 
We have no way to contact her!

00:16:42.070 --> 00:16:44.230
She really is lost...

00:16:45.660 --> 00:16:47.920
I'll go look for her!

00:16:49.020 --> 00:16:50.100
Hina-chan?

00:16:51.350 --> 00:16:53.500
Hina-chan left her phone...

00:16:56.600 --> 00:16:59.700
I think we're about to have a 
second lost child on our hands.

00:16:59.700 --> 00:17:00.870
Yeah...

00:17:01.160 --> 00:17:03.750
Mayu-chan!

00:17:04.070 --> 00:17:06.020
Where are you?

00:17:06.960 --> 00:17:10.000
Mayu-chan!

00:17:14.000 --> 00:17:16.760
I've looked so much, 
and still can't find her...

00:17:17.130 --> 00:17:19.770
Where in the world did she go?

00:17:21.090 --> 00:17:25.180
What? Me? Oh, I couldn't!

00:17:21.090 --> 00:17:25.570
Maybe she got scouted by someone in 
show business who happened to be here,

00:17:25.570 --> 00:17:28.770
and they took her to the 
scene of a drama filming?!

00:17:29.160 --> 00:17:31.040
As cute as she is, I can believe it...

00:17:31.040 --> 00:17:32.530
Excuse me!

00:17:32.780 --> 00:17:35.030
Could you take a picture of us?

00:17:36.510 --> 00:17:38.280
U-Um...

00:17:38.280 --> 00:17:40.280
A-Ah.... I...

00:17:46.870 --> 00:17:48.770
They're all coming to her!

00:17:48.770 --> 00:17:50.170
Wow!

00:17:52.190 --> 00:17:53.050
Oh?

00:17:55.890 --> 00:17:57.230
Did they find fish?

00:17:57.230 --> 00:17:59.220
But this is the shore...

00:18:04.410 --> 00:18:05.740
Hina-chan!

00:18:05.740 --> 00:18:08.560
Sensei, look! It's Hina-chan!

00:18:08.970 --> 00:18:11.400
Now I can get back to the others!

00:18:11.400 --> 00:18:12.930
That's wonderful.

00:18:12.930 --> 00:18:13.810
Yeah!

00:18:15.490 --> 00:18:17.450
Hina-chan!

00:18:23.160 --> 00:18:25.590
Mayu-chan!

00:18:26.660 --> 00:18:28.810
I'm so glad to see you!

00:18:28.810 --> 00:18:32.870
I was so scared all by myself!

00:18:32.870 --> 00:18:34.550
H-Huh?

00:18:38.030 --> 00:18:40.940
I can't tell which of them was actually lost.

00:18:43.770 --> 00:18:46.770
Mayu-chan and Hina-chan still aren't back.

00:18:46.770 --> 00:18:47.680
Yeah...

00:18:49.080 --> 00:18:50.940
Everyone!

00:18:53.170 --> 00:18:54.190
Hina-chan!

00:18:54.190 --> 00:18:55.930
Mayu-senpai's with her, too!

00:19:00.050 --> 00:19:01.840
I see...

00:19:01.840 --> 00:19:04.400
You ran into Mayu-chan while taking a walk.

00:19:04.400 --> 00:19:05.200
Yes.

00:19:05.200 --> 00:19:07.130
I'm so glad!

00:19:07.130 --> 00:19:10.290
I was worried, since you 
left your cell phones here!

00:19:11.960 --> 00:19:15.060
I'm surprised you made it back 
without losing your way.

00:19:15.060 --> 00:19:15.800
Yeah!

00:19:16.230 --> 00:19:18.610
The crabs showed me the way.

00:19:18.610 --> 00:19:22.680
I like mountain animals, too, 
but marine animals are really cute!

00:19:22.680 --> 00:19:28.100
Oh, right! Some people talked to me 
and I turned into a scarecrow,

00:19:28.100 --> 00:19:32.390
but then Mayu-chan happened 
to walk by and saved me!

00:19:32.390 --> 00:19:35.610
Huh? Mayu-senpai, you weren't lost?

00:19:35.610 --> 00:19:36.230
Huh?

00:19:36.400 --> 00:19:39.950
It's so cool that you helped 
Hina-chan when she was in trouble!

00:19:40.740 --> 00:19:43.180
U-Uh...

00:19:43.180 --> 00:19:46.250
You're like an older sister 
we can all count on!

00:19:47.960 --> 00:19:49.550
An older sister?

00:19:49.930 --> 00:19:52.480
Th-That's not true at all.

00:19:52.480 --> 00:19:54.460
No, no, it is!

00:19:54.460 --> 00:19:55.750
You think so?

00:19:55.750 --> 00:19:57.350
Of course!

00:19:56.580 --> 00:20:00.810
We won't tell anyone that 
she really was lost.

00:20:03.370 --> 00:20:06.050
Thanks, Ruri-chan!

00:20:03.370 --> 00:20:06.050
Thank you so much!

00:20:13.560 --> 00:20:15.730
<i>The horizon looks so pretty.</i>

00:20:16.060 --> 00:20:18.170
<i>And the sea breeze feels nice.</i>

00:20:18.910 --> 00:20:21.490
<i>It was so fun playing with everyone, too.</i>

00:20:23.220 --> 00:20:26.370
Hina-chan, how was your 
first visit to the ocean?

00:20:26.370 --> 00:20:27.990
It was so much fun!

00:20:28.250 --> 00:20:31.170
I wish I could live here forever!

00:20:32.710 --> 00:20:33.620
Huh?

00:20:34.780 --> 00:20:38.130
Are you animals from the mountains?

00:20:38.620 --> 00:20:41.000
I-It was just a joke!

00:20:41.000 --> 00:20:44.970
It's okay. I love all of you, too.

00:20:44.970 --> 00:20:47.970
<b>-New students welcoming party
-Welcoming party at the karaoke place near school
-Dinner near the karaoke place
-Planning to finish at 19:30
-Get RSVPs and make reservations
</b>

00:20:44.970 --> 00:20:47.970
<b>-Confirm what time everyone plans to go home
-Think about the event
-Come up with next year's club budget
-This month's club report
-Ideas on what we want to show the first-years (by 4/15)
-Party: 12 with student discount = 1080 yen per person 
-Dinner: Do we go with a 2 hour all-you-can-eat? Or eat something we all want?</b>

00:20:45.280 --> 00:20:47.970
Wh-Where did they come from?

00:20:48.180 --> 00:20:51.470
Hey! Let's all take a picture together!

00:20:51.470 --> 00:20:53.330
O-Okay!

00:20:58.250 --> 00:21:01.100
Aki-chan, hurry!

00:21:17.780 --> 00:21:18.920
Yua-chan?

00:21:28.740 --> 00:21:30.450
Everyone's asleep.

00:21:34.620 --> 00:21:37.880
<i>I'm starting to feel sleepy, too...</i>

00:21:39.220 --> 00:21:44.910
<i>I hope we can all come to 
the ocean together again next year.</i>

00:23:24.920 --> 00:23:35.890
<b>Trying Too Hard</b>

00:23:26.210 --> 00:23:29.360
My first visit to the ocean was so much fun!

00:23:29.360 --> 00:23:32.330
But I can't just play around all the time.

00:23:32.330 --> 00:23:34.630
I have to help Kuu-chan 
and Mayu-chan at work,

00:23:34.630 --> 00:23:36.730
and I have to study theater, too.

00:23:37.050 --> 00:23:39.030
Next time, "Trying Too Hard."
